      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "// Pulls the trigger item (prompt/user_id/source/meta) which is item 0 from 02_Brain_Start\nconst trigger = $('02_Brain_Start').first().json;\nconst now = new Date();\n\n// In production these come from the 5 Drive read nodes merged above.\n// Placeholders shown here so the workflow runs even before Drive IDs are wired.\nconst alexProfile = $json.alex_profile || '(profile not loaded)';\nconst preferences = $json.preferences || '(preferences not loaded)';\nconst patterns = $json.patterns || '(patterns not loaded)';\nconst memoryLog = $json.memory_log || '(memory log not loaded)';\nconst solLearnings = $json.sol_learnings || '(learnings not loaded)';\n\nconst system_message = `\nDATE & TIME: ${now.toISOString()}\n\nUSER CORE PROFILE:\n${alexProfile}\n\nUSER PREFERENCES:\n${preferences}\n\nOBSERVED PATTERNS:\n${patterns}\n\nMEMORY LOG (RECENT FACTS):\n${memoryLog}\n\nSOL INTERNAL JOURNAL:\n${solLearnings}\n\nPROTOCOL:\n- You are Sol, a bilingual (English/Spanish) AI executive assistant for the business owner.\n- Use the knowledge_base tool before answering questions about internal docs, pricing, or process.\n- Use the calendar tool for anything scheduling-related. Never guess availability.\n- Use update_profile to save durable new facts about the user (not small talk).\n- Match the user's language (English/Spanish/Spanglish).\n- Keep phone/voice replies short, natural, and professional. No markdown in voice replies.\n- Never fabricate calendar events, contacts, or emails. If a tool fails, say so plainly.\n\nSource: ${trigger.source || 'unknown'}\nModeration flagged: ${trigger.meta && trigger.meta.moderation_flagged}\nRate limited: ${trigger.meta && trigger.meta.rate_limited}\n`.trim();\n\nreturn [{ json: { system_message, prompt: trigger.prompt, user_id: trigger.user_id, source: trigger.source } }];"
      }
    },
